#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:5 ff786eb5d1614a03b1ac96f2ad0fec47
msgid "Land Mode"
msgstr "Land模式"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:7 759d23b7cdca4305869214ad9d39b247
msgid ""
"LAND Mode attempts to bring the copter straight down and has these features:"
msgstr "Land模式尝试使飞机垂直降落，具有以下特性："

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:10 bf41acba11d74da0a545b929c5060ae5
msgid ""
"descends at :ref:`LAND_SPEED_HIGH<LAND_SPEED_HIGH>`, if non-zero, (or "
":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_DN<WPNAV_SPEED_DN>` if zero) using the regular Altitude "
"Hold controller."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`LAND_SPEED_HIGH<LAND_SPEED_HIGH>` 不为零，则以该速度下降（若为零则使用 "
":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_DN<WPNAV_SPEED_DN>`），使用常规定高控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:11 56612798877f40e58d03acc68e873cf8
msgid ""
"the pilot can reposition the vehicle using the pitch and roll sticks. The "
"throttle stick has no effect."
msgstr "飞手可以使用俯仰和横滚摇杆调整飞行器位置。油门摇杆无效。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:12 68e8aa19b2574cab82c4e80b698749ee
msgid ""
"if a rangefinder is being used, or :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` =1 "
"and terrain data is available, the descent speed will then switch to "
":ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` at 10m altitude above ground until landing "
"occurs. If neither terrain data or rangefinder data is available, then "
"altitude above HOME will be used for the speed switch point (if reached)."
msgstr ""
"如果使用了测距仪，或 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` =1 "
"且地形数据可用，则在距地面10m高度时下降速度将切换为 "
":ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>`，直至降落完成。如果地形数据和测距仪数据均不可用，则将使用相对Home点的高度作为速度切换点（如能到达的话）。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:17 20f2913f3cf84b4bb56d0d0bcbb512c0
msgid ""
"below 10m the copter should descend at the rate specified in the "
":ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` parameter which defaults to 50cm/s."
msgstr "在10m以下，飞机应以 :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` 参数指定的速度下降，默认值为50cm/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:23 d147f6b3afcf46ffbfddfc7d605f8f0b
msgid ""
"Upon reaching the ground the copter will automatically shut-down the motors "
"and disarm the copter if the pilot's throttle is at minimum."
msgstr "触地后，如果飞手的油门处于最低位置，飞机将自动关闭电机并上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:28 9d4108558dda496aa625b99ca3a19508
msgid ""
"Copter will recognise that it has landed if the motors are being commanded "
"to be at low level by the vertical position controller, its climb rate "
"remains between -20cm/s and +20cm/s, and is not accelerating for one second."
"  It does not use the altitude to decide whether to shut off the motors "
"except that the copter must also be below 10m above the home altitude, "
"unless a rangefinder is being used, in which case it must be within 2m of "
"the ground."
msgstr ""
"ArduCopter将在以下条件满足时判定已降落：垂直位置控制器命令电机处于低功率输出、爬升率保持在-20cm/s至+20cm/s之间，且持续1秒无加速度。除此之外，飞机还必须位于Home点高度10m以内（如使用测距仪，则必须距地面2m以内），但不使用高度判断是否关闭电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:34 6fdf689a0ba546f68cbf0e21f36940cc
msgid ""
"For Traditional Heli, the low motor check in the above landing detection "
"algorithm is replaced with a check that Collective output is below mid-"
"position (controlled by the vertical position controller, ie in descent). "
"The rotor still may be at governor speed up until Motor Interlock is removed"
" and  disarming occurs."
msgstr ""
"对于传统直升机，上述降落检测算法中的低电机输出检查被替换为检查总距输出是否低于中间位置（由垂直位置控制器控制，即处于下降状态）。在电机互锁解除和解锁发生之前，旋翼仍可能保持调速器转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:37 ba4bff645f23427f80687b579848dddf
msgid ""
"Using a Weight on Wheels (WoW) switch will increase the descent rate and "
"accelerometer ranges that are acceptable for landing detection. This feature"
" is enabled anytime the LGR_WOW_PIN is not disabled."
msgstr "使用轮载（WoW）开关将扩大降落检测可接受的下降速率和加速度计范围。只要LGR_WOW_PIN未被禁用，此功能即会启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:42 bef96122b44f42faac672ac08abcbe6b
msgid ""
"If the copter appears to bounce or balloon back up a couple of times before "
"settling down and turning the props off, try lowering the "
":ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` parameter a bit."
msgstr "如果飞机在停止并关闭螺旋桨之前出现多次弹跳或反弹上升，请尝试适当降低 :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` 参数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:45 1fcd76fdac1c43ae91e99bcf7ea03cfc
msgid ""
"If the vehicle has GPS lock the landing controller will attempt to control "
"its horizontal position but the pilot can adjust the target horizontal "
"position just as in Loiter mode."
msgstr "如果飞行器已获取GPS锁定，降落控制器将尝试控制其水平位置，飞手可以像在Loiter模式下一样调整目标水平位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:48 720ae08ef06a4863959fbb402cbdf4c3
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not have GPS lock the horizontal control will be as in "
"stabilize mode so the pilot can control the roll and pitch lean angle of the"
" copter."
msgstr "如果飞行器未获取GPS锁定，水平控制将与Stabilize模式相同，飞手可以控制飞机的横滚和俯仰倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:55 97e1e66a70174873b5226ec0d503759d
msgid ""
"In any Alt Hold based mode including: Alt Hold, Loiter, Auto, Auto NAV_Land "
"or RTL if your copters operation becomes erratic when you are close to the "
"ground or landing (and also if any auto landing procedure results in "
"bouncing or failure to turn off motors properly after landing) you probably "
"have the autopilot situated such that its barometer (altimeter) is being "
"affected by the pressure created by the copters prop-wash against the "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"在任何基于定高的模式中，包括：AltHold、Loiter、Auto、Auto NAV_Land 或 "
"RTL，如果在接近地面或降落时飞机操控异常（以及任何自动降落程序导致弹跳或降落后无法正常关闭电机），很可能是飞控被放置在受到螺旋桨下洗气流打地面后气压变化影响的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:65 fbdc959933b74afe98737d1f809cb37e
msgid ""
"This is easily verified by looking at the Altimeter reading in your logs and"
" seeing if it spikes or oscillates when near the ground."
msgstr "可通过查看日志中的高度计读数，观察接近地面时是否出现尖峰或振荡来验证这一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:67 fc45b1e974984e5bbbfb40ee8fd60dce
msgid ""
"If this is a problem, move the autopilot out of prop wash effect or shield "
"it with an appropriately ventilated enclosure."
msgstr "如果存在此问题，请将飞控移至不受螺旋桨下洗气流影响的位置，或用具有适当通风的外壳对其进行屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:69 52f5f4070eea4b028ff6c2a68b3999f0
msgid "Success can be verified by flight test and by log results."
msgstr "可通过飞行测试和日志结果进行验证。"
